+r],e,esize], fp_addend, FALSE\);&#13;            else&#13;                addend = if add then op1val*op2val else -op1val*op2val;&#13;                if long_destination then&#13;                    Elem[Q[d&gt;&gt;1],e,2\*esize] = Elem[Qin[d&gt;&gt;1],e,2*esize] + addend;&#13;                else&#13;                    Elem[D[d+r],e,esize] = Elem[Din[d+r],e,esize] + addend;</span></p></body>)/RD[0.470184 0.470184 0.470184 0.470184]/Type/Annot/Popup 6407 0 R/AP<</N 17285 0 R>>>>endobj6407 0 obj<</Rect[6.41168 98.3102 416.812 359.474]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 6406 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj6408 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20110315121740Z)/Rect[488.713 217.515 508.713 235.515]/NM(e829382e-934a-49a2-bd80-c49ccec3dea2)/Subtype/Text/CA 0.505005/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/F 28/Contents(The replacement pseudocode removes a read-after-write error.\r\rThe insertion in the section Pseudocode details of Advanced SIMD and VFP extension registers on page A2-23 [PDF page 55] defines the Din[] and Qin[] functions.)/M(D:20110712122058+01'00')/Name/Comment/P 6402 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Sticky Note)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">The replacement pseudocode removes a read-after-write error.&#13;&#13;The insertion in the section </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic">Pseudocode\ details of Advanced SIMD and VFP extension registers</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> on page A2-23 [PDF page 55] defines the Din[] and Qin[] functions.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 6409 0 R/AP<</N 17283 0 R>>>>endobj6409 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 115.515 720.0 235.515]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 6408 0 R/F