at2 then FPSCR.QC = '1';</span></p></body>)/RD[0.470184 0.470184 0.470184 0.470184]/Type/Annot/Popup 6721 0 R/AP<</N 17335 0 R>>>>endobj6721 0 obj<</Rect[19.9475 94.8819 393.039 349.5]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 6720 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj6722 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20110315123203Z)/Rect[485.863 228.201 505.863 246.201]/NM(0da1360b-b1f0-4ee3-ab9f-0be95e23c236)/Subtype/Text/CA 0.505005/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/F 28/Contents(The replacement pseudocode removes a read-after-write error.\r\rThe insertion in the section Pseudocode details of Advanced SIMD and VFP extension registers on page A2-23 [PDF page 55] defines the Din[] and Qin[] functions.)/M(D:20110712122058+01'00')/Name/Comment/P 6716 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Sticky Note)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">The replacement pseudocode removes a read-after-write error.&#13;&#13;The insertion in the section </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic">Pseudocode\ details of Advanced SIMD and VFP extension registers</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> on page A2-23 [PDF page 55] defines the Din[] and Qin[] functions.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 6723 0 R/AP<</N 17334 0 R>>>>endobj6723 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 94.1424 720.0 214.142]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 6722 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj6724 0 obj<</Length 1950/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
