CR.INTdis. For more information about masking by DBGDSCR.INTdis see </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;f\ont-style:italic">Debug Status and Control Register \(DBGDSCR\)</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> on page C10-10 [PDF page 1778].&#13;&#13;The DBGDSCR.INTdis bit can mask int\errupts only when both DBGDSCR[15:14] != 00 and invasive debug is enabled. Otherwise DBGDSCR.INTdis does not affect WFE wake-up events.&#13;&#13;The final insertion in this lists adds an additional bullet, that identifies the possibility of an IMPLEMENTAT\ION DEFINED wake-up mechanism.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 7798 0 R/AP<</N 17460 0 R>>>>endobj7798 0 obj<</Rect[77.5386 291.034 473.537 511.615]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 7797 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj7799 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20110321144641Z)/Rect[397.726 117.941 405.966 129.241]/NM(b3486fe8-64c8-4dc9-a016-2db12de76d27)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/M(D:20110321144641Z)/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/P 7777 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[400.721 128.613 402.971 128.613 400.721 118.569 402.971 118.569]/IRT 7801 0 R/RT/Group/Type/Annot/Popup 7800 0 R/AP<</N 17465 0 R>>>>endobj7800 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 8.61296 720.0 128.613]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 7799 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj7801 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20110321144641Z)/Rect[398.996 118.21 407.211 124.904]/NM(cbc892ba-c73b-4bee-9385-6a70edefa805)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/Contents(\r Ä an event sent by some IMPLEMENTATION DEFINED mechanism.)/IT/Replace/M(D:20110321144717Z)/P 7777 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Replacement Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:nor