eft;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Without a </span><sp\an dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">context synchronization operation, the </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l"> change becomes visible at some point after the instruction that changed the CP15 registers. &#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> &#8226; However, until a </span><span d\ir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">context synchronization operation</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> has oc\curred, the architecture does not guarantee that the change is visible.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 9234 0 R/AP<</N 17625 0 R>>>>endobj9234 0 obj<</Rect[160.398 50.8486 444.47 171.939]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 9233 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj9235 0 obj<</Length 3796/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
