"\ style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> on PDF page 1363 also applies to a PMSA implementation.&#13;&#13;The other changes in this section only add short names for the MPIDR register fields. They do no\t affect functionality.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 10557 0 R/AP<</N 17828 0 R>>>>endobj10557 0 obj<</Rect[351.66 99.8143 554.569 293.56]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10556 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10558 0 obj<</Rect[216.784 304.37 277.446 315.67]/CreationDate(D:20081106155746Z)/NM(5b5995c1-edb1-4d29-8e23-70418954ad8a)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/M(D:20081124154519Z)/P 10550 0 R/T(ARM_2008_Q4)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[219.779 315.042 274.451 315.042 219.779 304.998 274.451 304.998]/IRT 10560 0 R/RT/Group/Type/Annot/Popup 10559 0 R/AP<</N 17838 0 R>>>>endobj10559 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 195.042 720.0 315.042]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10558 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10560 0 obj<</Rect[270.295 304.106 278.74 310.986]/CreationDate(D:20081106155746Z)/NM(1b1c5912-ab45-4baf-aba2-d8b119f1b2f0)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/Contents(Aff2)/M(D:20081124154519Z)/IT/Replace/P 10550 0 R/T(ARM_2008_Q4)/Subj(Replacement Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">Aff2</span></p></body>)/RD[0.573364 0.573364 0.573364 0.573364]/Type/Annot/Popup 10561 0 R/AP<</N 17822 0 R>>>>endobj10561 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 190.413 720.0 310.413]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10560 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10562 0 obj<</Rect[312.976 304.37 373.622 315.67]/CreationDate(D:20081106155751Z)/NM(ffb2d73b-4af8-4d63-89d4-9ccfc5cbe836)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/M(D:20081124154519Z)/P 10550 0 R/T(ARM_