mplementations. It is not associated with any ARMv7 a\rchitecture extension.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 10724 0 R/AP<</N 17855 0 R>>>>endobj10724 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 300.462 720.0 420.462]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10723 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10725 0 obj<</Rect[103.397 396.03 113.087 407.704]/CreationDate(D:20110322183756Z)/NM(c786e81d-fd9c-428f-a655-3be28b329a6d)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[1.0 0.0 0.0]/F 4/M(D:20110322183756Z)/P 10718 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[106.491 407.055 109.992 407.055 106.491 396.678 109.992 396.678]/Type/Annot/Popup 10726 0 R/AP<</N 17858 0 R>>>>endobj10726 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 287.055 720.0 407.055]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10725 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10727 0 obj<</Rect[121.057 396.03 139.243 407.704]/CreationDate(D:20110322183803Z)/NM(355e0ba2-71ee-41ec-95e4-bf2269eb889a)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[1.0 0.0 0.0]/F 4/M(D:20110322183803Z)/P 10718 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[124.152 407.055 136.149 407.055 124.152 396.678 136.149 396.678]/Type/Annot/Popup 10728 0 R/AP<</N 17856 0 R>>>>endobj10728 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 287.055 720.0 407.055]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10727 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10729 0 obj<</Rect[229.769 395.819 237.983 402.513]/CreationDate(D:20110322183825Z)/NM(106b0b3f-7d08-4377-8317-b52a2aeb0f07)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/Contents(TRCDIS, bit[28] \r    Disable CP14 access to trace registers:\r    0	 This bit does not cause any instructions to be undefined.\r    1	 Any MRC or MCR instruction with coproc set to 0b1110 and opc1 set to 0b001 is UNDEFINED.\r\rOn an implementation that:\r\ Ä Does not include a trace macrocell, or does not include a CP14 interface to the trace macrocell registers, this bit is RAZ/WI.\r Ä Includes a CP14 interface to trace macrocell registers, it is IMPLEMENTATION DEFINED whether this bit is supported. If it\ is not supported it is RAZ/WI.\r\rIf this bit is implemented as an RW bit its reset value is UNKNOWN.)/M(D:20110322183857Z)/P 10718 0 R/T(ghawes)/Subj(Inserted Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:bold;font-style:normal">TRCDIS, bit[28] </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#13;    Disable CP14 access to trace registers:&#13;    0&#9; This bit does not cause any inst\ructions to be undefined.&#13;    1&#9; Any MRC or MCR instruction with coproc set to 0b1110 and opc1 set to 0b001 is UNDEFINED.&#13;&#13;On an implementation that:&#13; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weig\ht:normal;font-style:normal">&#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Does not include a trace macrocell, or does not include a CP14 interface to the trace macrocell registe\rs, this bit is RAZ/WI.&#13; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-sty\le:normal">Includes a CP14 interface to trace macrocell registers, it is IMPLEMENTATION DEFINED whether this bit is supported. If it is not supported it is RAZ/WI.&#13;&#13;If this bit is implemented as an RW bit its reset value is UNKNOWN.</span></p></bo\dy>)/RD[0.55777 0.55777 0.55777 0.55777]/Type/Annot/Popup 10730 0 R/AP<</N 17857 0 R>>>>endobj10730 0 obj<</Rect[86.1982 238.09 492.016 372.926]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 10729 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj10731 0 obj<</Length 3044/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
