r:#000000;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal">SPIDEN</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left\;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> is LOW, the debug event is not taken if, as a result of taking the imprecise exception, SCR.NS = 0. This is because taking the debug event would be a security hole.&#13;----------------</span></p></bod\y>)/RD[0.558502 0.558502 0.558502 0.558502]/Type/Annot/Popup 11979 0 R/AP<</N 17995 0 R>>>>endobj11979 0 obj<</Rect[74.6689 213.998 583.252 422.799]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 11978 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj11980 0 obj<</Length 1129/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
