===========&#13;&#13;ARM al\so deprecates using the Extended CP14 interface to write to the following bits of the Debug &#13;Power-down and Reset Control Register, DBGPRCR:&#13;  </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-styl\e:normal">&#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">DBGPRCR[2], Hold non-debug logic reset&#13;  </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;f\ont-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">DBGPRCR[1], Warm reset request.&#13;&#13;&#13;&#13;</span></p></body>)/RD[0.559052 0.559082 0.559052 0.559082]/Type/Annot/Popup 12646 0 R/AP<</N 18068 0 R>>>>endobj12646 0 obj<</Rect[26.6822 254.446 466.535 545.718]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 12645 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj12647 0 obj<</Length 2835/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
