 an implementation performs no speculative accesses t\o memory, including to instruction memory. The implementation does not pipeline any phase of execution. In practice, this is the theoretical execution model that the architecture is based on, and ARM does not expect this model to correspond to a realistic\ implementation of the architecture.&#13;&#13;</span></p></body>)/RD[0.57785 0.57785 0.57785 0.57785]/Type/Annot/Popup 16515 0 R/AP<</N 18270 0 R>>>>endobj16515 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 237.511 720.0 357.511]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 16514 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj16516 0 obj<</Rect[59.1606 95.0598 488.806 130.219]/CreationDate(D:20090624173455+01'00')/NM(093a56e0-4678-4a20-99df-e9de55adac2e)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[1.0 0.0 0.0]/F 132/M(D:20090710121233+01'00')/P 16512 0 R/T(ARM_2009_Q2)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[62.361 129.543 96.046 129.543 62.361 118.833 96.046 118.833 104.904 128.967 284.175 128.967 104.904 118.923 284.175 118.923 286.414 128.982 304.377 128.982 286.414 118.055 304.377 118.055 304.373 128.982 383.625 128.982 304.373 118.938 383.625 118.938 104.883 117.345 117.213 117.345 104.883 107.301 117.213 107.301 119.463 117.345 137.277 117.345 119.463 106.475 137.277 106.475 137.272 117.342 485.783 117.342 137.272 107.298 485.783 107.298 104.886 105.759 395.515 105.759 104.886 95.7151 395.515 95.7151]/Type/Annot/Popup 16517 0 R/AP<</N 18271 0 R>>>>endobj16517 0 obj<</Rect[540.0 9.54292 720.0 129.543]/Subtype/Popup/Parent 16516 0 R/F 28/Open false/Type/Annot>>endobj16518 0 obj<</Length 3583/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
