;font-style:normal"> &#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Without a </span><sp\an dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">context synchronization operation, the </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l"> change becomes visible at some point after the instruction that changed the CP15 registers. &#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> &#8226; However, until a </span><span d\ir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">context synchronization operation</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> has oc\curred, the architecture does not guarantee that the change is visible.</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#13;</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 10473 0 R/AP<</N 17807 0 R>>>>endobj10474 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20101214140441Z)/Rect[141.584 248.254 148.785 254.12]/NM(5b6bafe0-c4b9-4621-8a6f-ad1f466cc2ad)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/Contents(0, )/M(D:20110712123917+01'00')/P 10470 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Inserted Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">0, </span></p></body>)/RD[0.488892 0.488892 0.488892 0.488892]/Type/Annot/Popup 10475 0 R/AP<</N 17808 0 R>>>>endobj10707 0 obj<</Rect[99.7125 304.679 501.14 388.567]/CreationDate(D:20110318190953Z)/NM(357a9004-c479-4e13-bfee-c9e4dcf41df0)/Subtype/Line/C[1.