/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/Contents(TRCDIS, bit[28] \r    Disable CP14 access to trace registers:\r    0	 This bit does not cause any instructions to be undefined.\r    1	 Any MRC or MCR instruction with coproc set to 0b1110 and opc1 set to 0b001 is UNDEFINED.\r\rOn an implementation that:\r\ Ä Does not include a trace macrocell, or does not include a CP14 interface to the trace macrocell registers, this bit is RAZ/WI.\r Ä Includes a CP14 interface to trace macrocell registers, it is IMPLEMENTATION DEFINED whether this bit is supported. If it\ is not supported it is RAZ/WI.\r\rIf this bit is implemented as an RW bit its reset value is UNKNOWN.)/M(D:20110712123917+01'00')/P 10718 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Inserted Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:bold;font-style:normal">TRCDIS, bit[28] </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#13;    Disable CP14 access to trace registers:&#13;    0&#9; This bit does not cause any inst\ructions to be undefined.&#13;    1&#9; Any MRC or MCR instruction with coproc set to 0b1110 and opc1 set to 0b001 is UNDEFINED.&#13;&#13;On an implementation that:&#13; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weig\ht:normal;font-style:normal">&#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Does not include a trace macrocell, or does not include a CP14 interface to the trace macrocell registe\rs, this bit is RAZ/WI.&#13; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-sty\le:normal">Includes a CP14 interface to trace macrocell registers, it is IMPLEMENTATION DEFINED whether this bit is supported. If it is not supported it is RAZ/WI.&#13;&#13;If this bit is implemented as an RW bit its reset value is UNKNOWN.</span></p></bo\dy>)/RD[0.55777 0.55777 0.55777 0.55777]/Type/Annot/Popup 10730 0 R/AP<</N 17857 0 R>>>>endobj10874 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20101217164138Z)/Rect[261.894 514.687 284.957 525.488]/NM(412a8b2b-fc4e-47ef-b44f-1bc0d6369d92)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/M(D:20110712123917+01'00')/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/P 10865 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[264.757 524.888 282.094 524.888 264.757 515.288 282.094 515.288]/IRT 10876 0 R/RT/Group/Type/Annot/Popup 10875 0 R/AP<</N 17863 0 R>>>>endobj10876 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20101217164138Z)/Rect[278.349 514.751 286.354 521.273]/NM(2bdf58ba-71e6-4493-91cb-b5d4eb021748)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/Contents(UNPREDICTABLE)/IT/Replace/M(D:20110712123917+01'00')/P 10865 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Replacement Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">UNPREDICTABLE</span></p></body>)/RD[0.543518 0.543518 0.543518 0.543518]/Type/Annot/Popup 10877 0 R/AP<</N 17864 0 R>>>>endobj10878 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20101217164141Z)/Rect[261.889 412.636 284.951 423.436]/NM(7350ee15-7b50-4d0a-bcd8-0a4bdca4f190)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 4/M(D:20110712123917+01'00')/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/P 10865 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[264.752 422.836 282.088 422.836 264.752 413.236 282.088 413.236]/IRT 10880 0 R/RT/Group/Type/Annot/Popup 10879 0 R/AP<</N 17866 0 R>>>>endobj10880 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20101217164141Z)/Rect[278.349 412.398 286.354 418.921]/NM(3318b6c4-9fbe-46ab-9fc4-0125a03f0cbc)