t the end of this Note adds an additional subsection, Interaction of UNPREDICTABLE and UNDEFINED instruction behavior.)/M(D:20110712123706+01'00')/Name/Comment/P 7860 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Sticky Note)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">The insertion at the end of this Note adds an additional subsection, </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal">Interaction of UNPREDICTABLE and UNDEFINED\ instruction behavior</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 7866 0 R/AP<</N 17477 0 R>>>>endobj7982 0 obj<</Rect[102.306 64.1285 200.705 102.759]/CreationDate(D:20110315091233Z)/NM(7f141f99-c5d4-4ad1-9bee-0c56acc637ac)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/M(D:20110712123706+01'00')/P 7974 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[104.88 102.219 198.131 102.219 104.88 93.586 198.131 93.586 104.88 92.6181 198.131 92.6181 104.88 83.9848 198.131 83.9848 104.88 73.3014 186.489 73.3014 104.88 64.6681 186.489 64.6681]/IRT 7984 0 R/RT/Group/Type/Annot/Popup 7983 0 R/AP<</N 17492 0 R>>>>endobj7984 0 obj<</Rect[183.189 64.0662 190.114 69.7085]/CreationDate(D:20110315091233Z)/NM(32c76086-63f6-4682-8e92-c09df38e18dc)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/Contents(// CheckAdvSIMDEnabled\(\)\r// =====================\r\rCheckAdvSIMDEnabled\(\)\r    result = CheckAdvSIMDOrVFPEnabled\(TRUE, TRUE\);\r\r    if result then\r        // Make temporary copy of D registers\r        for i = 0 to 31\r	    _Dclone[i] = _D[i]\r\r\    return result;)/M(D:20110712123706+01'00')/IT/Replace/P 7974 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Replacement Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">// CheckAdvSIMDEnabled\(\)&#13;// =====================&#13;&#13;CheckAdvSIMDEnabled\(\)&#13;    result = CheckAdvSIMDOrVFPEnabled\(TRUE, TRUE\);&#13;&#13;    if result then&#13;        // Make temporary copy of D registers&\#13;        for i = 0 to 31&#13;&#9;    _Dclone[i] = _D[i]&#13;&#13;    return result;</span></p></body>)/RD[0.470184 0.470184 0.470184 0.470184]/Type/Annot/Popup 7985 0 R/AP<</N 17495 0 R>>>>endobj7986 0 obj<</Rect[463.066 74.3204 483.066 92.3204]/CreationDate(D:20110315091347Z)/NM(14ba8f4c-f914-454b-b3b9-e8b381997e6c)/Subtype/Text/CA 0.505005/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/F 156/Contents(This change permits instruction pseudocode to use the _Dclone[] array as the input data for the operation, avoiding possible read-after-write errors. See, for example, the corrected instruction pseudocode for VABA on page A8-527 [PDF page 839].)/M(D:20110712123706+01'00')/Name/Comment/P 7974 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Sticky Note)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.6" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">This change permits instruction pseudocode to use the _Dclone[] array as the input data for the operation, avoiding possible read-after-write errors. See, for example, the corrected instruction pseudocode for VABA on page A8\-527 [PDF page 839].</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 7987 0 R/AP<</N 17493 0 R>>>>endobj8005 0 obj<</Rect[108.006 578.458 284.114 588.171]/CreationDate(D:20110315091308Z)/NM(8aa0ab49-1d9a-4844-b6e7-afb4e9146fc2)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[1.0 0.0 0.0]/F 132/Conten