t:normal;font-style:normal"> opc1 == 0, CRm == c13, opc2 == 1.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 9225 0 R/AP<</N 17624 0 R>>>>endobj9233 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20101118163504Z)/Rect[484.723 180.562 504.723 198.562]/NM(287585d6-fce0-40ea-8a10-dae95666193f)/Subtype/Text/CA 0.505005/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/F 156/Contents(To clarify the intended meaning of this statement:\rThe events listed can be described as context synchronization operations.\r Ä Without a context synchronization operation, the  change becomes visible at some point after the instruction that changed the\ CP15 registers. \r Ä However, until a context synchronization operation has occurred, the architecture does not guarantee that the change is visible.)/M(D:20110712123706+01'00')/Name/Comment/P 9231 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Sticky Note)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">To clarify the intended meaning of this statement:&#13;The events listed can be described as </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic">context synchroni\zation operations</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">.</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&#13;</s\pan><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> &#8226; </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Without a </span><sp\an dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">context synchronization operation, the </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l"> change becomes visible at some point after the instruction that changed the CP15 registers. &#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> &#8226; However, until a </span><span d\ir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">context synchronization operation</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"> has oc\curred, the architecture does not guarantee that the change is visible.</span></p></body>)/Type/Annot/Popup 9234 0 R/AP<</N 17625 0 R>>>>endobj9238 0 obj<</Rect[141.584 467.512 148.785 473.379]/CreationDate(D:20101214140404Z)/NM(8ce61af2-2c7d-492b-b482-986e9d769ca1)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/Contents(0, )/M(D:20110712123706+01'00')/P 9236 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Inserted Text)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:8.2.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-we\ight:normal;font-style:normal">0, </span></p></body>)/RD[0.488892 0.488892 0.488892 0.488892]/Type/Annot/Popup 9239 0 R/AP<</N 17626 0 R>>>>endobj9466 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20110324154202Z)/Rect[107.488 433.218 118.432 445.372]/NM(2ea0a686-0f70-4646-a0f4-c575b29bd8c7)/Subtype/StrikeOut/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/M(D:20110712123741+01'00')/IT/StrikeOutTextEdit/P 9460 0 R/T(ARM_2011_Q2)/Subj(Cross-Out)/QuadPoints[110.71 444.697 115.21 444.697 110.71 433.894 115.21 433.894]/IRT 9468 0 R/RT/Group/Type/Annot/Popup 9467 0 R/AP<</N 17679 0 R>>>>endobj9468 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20110324154202Z)/Rect[111.082 433.547 119.718 440.584]/NM(6c3bf798-1450-4040-9a79-a63a079b8dae)/Subtype/Caret/C[0.0 0.0 1.0]/F 132/Contents(\(0\))/IT/Replace/